e="c61" target="c60"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1125" y="827"/><mxPoint x="1125" y="747"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="165" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;startFill=0;endFill=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;startArrow=ERzeroToOne;endArrow=ERmandOne;strokeColor=#334155;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;strokeColor=#64748b;exitX=0;exitY=0.581;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.488;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c61" target="c42"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1113" y="834"/><mxPoint x="1113" y="921"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="166" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;startFill=0;endFill=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;startArrow=ERzeroToOne;endArrow=ERmandOne;strokeColor=#334155;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;strokeColor=#64748b;exitX=0;exitY=0.467;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.575;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c62" target="c42"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1149" y="873"/><mxPoint x="1149" y="928"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="167" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;startFill=0;endFill=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;startArrow=ERzeroToMany;endArrow=ERmandOne;strokeColor=#334155;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;strokeColor=#64748b;exitX=0;exitY=0.355;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.672;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c63" target="c43"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="975" y="648"/><mxPoint x="975" y="352.25"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="168" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;startFill=0;endFill=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;startArrow=ERzeroToMany;endArrow=ERmandOne;strokeColor=#334155;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;strokeColor=#64748b;exitX=0;exitY=0.581;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.225;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c63" target="c42"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1017" y="655"/><mxPoint x="1017" y="900"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="169" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Areas: &lt;font color=&quot;#1d4ed8&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; A1 Identity, accounts, farm and boxes · &lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; A2 Batch, Standard Cost, funding and contracts · &lt;font color=&quot;#0369a1&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; A3 Production, evidence and alerts · &lt;font color=&quot;#0f766e&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; A4 Harvest, traceability and pricing · &lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; A5 Bulk orders, invoices and complaints · &lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; A6 Payments, settlement and audit.&lt;br&gt;Each line is one foreign key: crow's foot at the child end (O&amp;lt; many, O| one-to-one), bar at the parent end (| required, O| optional). Audit references to User (ApprovedBy, CreatedBy, ReviewedBy…) are not drawn.&lt;br&gt;Grey dashed box or line = «planned» (Register v1.4, not in code yet). Types, keys and attributes: area pages 4.2.1–4.2.6." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1225" width="1642" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="170" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes – Register v1.4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Removed from the business model but still used by code (tables stay in the Physical ERD, Figure 4.3): ProductListing, PriceHistory, PriceCheck (Listing / Catalog); OrderLine, StockReservation (Cart / retail checkout); OfftakeCommitment, BatchOfftakePrice (Offtake window); CrabTag, TagScan (printed tag); ProductionThreshold (water-quality thresholds). Attributes removed with them: SalesOrder.OfftakeId, PaymentRequest.OfftakeId, Crab.OrderLineId, CrabHistory.TagId, HarvestRecord.TagId / TagCode / TagStatus, ProductionLog.WaterTempC / SalinityPpt / Ph / ThresholdVersionId.&lt;br&gt;• Many-to-many decomposed: User × role → UserRole; Investor × RiskDisclosure → RiskAcknowledgement; Batch × Investor → CapitalShare; Contribution × BoxRow → RowAllocation «planned» (a BoxRow belongs to one Batch and, once allocated, to one Investor).&lt;br&gt;• 3NF: attributes marked / are derived values or copies stored once as snapshots and never edited — settlement money (ActualRevenue, LockedStandardCost of the boxes actually funded, RevenuePool, OperatorRemuneration, NetPayout, SurvivalRatePct), Batch.TotalConfirmedCapital, PlatformFeeAmount (fee at approval) and MinContribution (capital of one BoxRow), BoxRow.BoxCount and CapitalVnd, the PreOrderQuota counters kept under a row lock, SalesOrder.BalanceVnd and the delivery details copied at order time (RecipientName, RecipientPhone, ShippingAddress), HarvestRecord copies of BoxCode, GradeCode, GradeName and running totals (append-only weighing record, V016 trigger). FK* = the column is also part of a composite foreign key that keeps both rows in the same Batch (for example SettlementLine.BatchId with InvestorId → CapitalShare).&lt;br&gt;• SalesOrder.CustomerId references User so that an Investor can also pre-order (Register v1.4, section 3.2c). SalesOrder subtypes (BulkPreOrder, InvoicedSale, FinalOrder) are one table with OrderType; SaleReason (LowGrade, ForfeitResale) applies to InvoicedSale; CrabCount, EstimatedKg, DepositAmount, WeighedKg, TransitLossKg, BalanceVnd and ForfeitedAt apply to BulkPreOrder. Every delivered order has one Invoice; the FinalOrder is never below Batch.FloorPriceVnd. PreOrderQuota and PreOrderHold (15-minute hold per order) stop overselling of bulk pre-orders (TL-28).&lt;br&gt;• Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead (Batch opening condition, box rows, forfeited deposits, survival rate, weighed-kg balance, unused Standard Cost, InvoicedSale)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1306" width="1642" height="196" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="A1 · Identity, accounts, farm and boxes" id="A1___Identity__accounts__farm_and_boxes"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.2.1 – Logical ERD: Identity, accounts, farm and boxes (Register v1.4)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · crow's foot · 12 entities + 1 parent entities of other areas or parts (white, key only) · lines start at the foreign-key row&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="996" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;User&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=26;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;html=1;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;startSize=28;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="416" y="690" width="300" height="172" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; UserId: Integer" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portCo