ld end O&amp;lt; (many), | &amp;lt; (one or more) or O| (one-to-one); parent end | (required) or O| (optional).&lt;br&gt;Grey dashed = «planned» (Register v1.4, not in code); amber «changed» = meaning or values change in v1.4. White box = parent entity of another area or part, key only. Audit references to User are not drawn. Removed items: Notes of Figure 4.2." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1104" width="1462" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="118" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead (box rows)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1183" width="1462" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="A2 (1 of 2) · Batch, Standard Cost and disbursement" id="A2__1_of_2____Batch__Standard_Cost_and_disbursement"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.2.2 (1/2) – Logical ERD: Batch, Standard Cost, funding and contracts — Batch, Standard Cost and disbursement (Register v1.4)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · crow's foot · 8 entities + 1 parent entities of other areas or parts (white, key only) · lines start at the foreign-key row&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" 