xGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="759" y="158"/><mxPoint x="759" y="177"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="87" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK identifier · FK reference (the line starts at this row) · FK* also part of a composite FK that keeps both rows in the same Batch · U single-attribute business key · BK (…) composite business key · [0..1] optional · / derived or snapshot value.&lt;br&gt;Types are DBMS-independent: Integer, Money (integer VND), Decimal, Text, Date, DateTime, Boolean, UUID. Crow's foot: child end O&amp;lt; (many), | &amp;lt; (one or more) or O| (one-to-one); parent end | (required) or O| (optional).&lt;br&gt;Grey dashed = «planned» (Register v1.4, not in code); amber «changed» = meaning or values change in v1.4. White box = parent entity of another area or part, key only. Audit references to User are not drawn. Removed items: Notes of Figure 4.2." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="830" width="1092" height="114" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="88" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead (row allocation statuses, contribution = capital of its box rows)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="954" width="1092" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="A3 (1 of 2) · Production logs, box events and crabs" id="A3__1_of_2____Production_logs__box_events_and_crabs"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Figure 4.2.3 (1/2) – Logical ERD: Production, evidence and alerts — Production logs, box events and crabs (Register v1.4)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#64748b&quot;&gt;v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4 · crow's foot · 7 entities + 7 parent entities of other areas or parts (white, key only) · lines start at the foreign-key row&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1013" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;Crab&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=26;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;html=1;fillColor=#e0f2fe;strokeColor=#0369a1;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Segoe UI;startSize=28;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="416" y="134" width="300" height="252" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; CrabId: Integer" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="c3"><mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#b91c1c&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;U&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; CrabUuid: UUID" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;fontSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="