nt x="366" y="345.3333333333333"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="79" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;startFill=0;endFill=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;startArrow=ERzeroToMany;endArrow=ERzeroToOne;strokeColor=#334155;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;strokeColor=#64748b;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.189;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c47" target="c35"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1101" y="380"/><mxPoint x="1101" y="105"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="80" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;startFill=0;endFill=0;fontFamily=Segoe UI;startArrow=ERzeroToMany;endArrow=ERzeroToOne;strokeColor=#334155;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;strokeColor=#64748b;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.672;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c52" target="c65"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="743" y="390"/><mxPoint x="743" y="623"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="81" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK identifier · FK reference (the line starts at this row) · FK* also part of a composite FK that keeps both rows in the same Batch · U single-attribute business key · BK (…) composite business key · [0..1] optional · / derived or snapshot value.&lt;br&gt;Types are DBMS-independent: Integer, Money (integer VND), Decimal, Text, Date, DateTime, Boolean, UUID. Crow's foot: child end O&amp;lt; (many), | &amp;lt; (one or more) or O| (one-to-one); parent end | (required) or O| (optional).&lt;br&gt;Grey dashed = «planned» (Register v1.4, not in code); amber «changed» = meaning or values change in v1.4. White box = parent entity of another area or part, key only. Audit references to User are not drawn. Removed items: Notes of Figure 4.2." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;