b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK identifier · FK reference (the line starts at this row) · FK* also part of a composite FK that keeps both rows in the same Batch · U single-attribute business key · BK (…) composite business key · [0..1] optional · / derived or snapshot value.&lt;br&gt;Types are DBMS-independent: Integer, Money (integer VND), Decimal, Text, Date, DateTime, Boolean, UUID. Crow's foot: child end O&amp;lt; (many), | &amp;lt; (one or more) or O| (one-to-one); parent end | (required) or O| (optional).&lt;br&gt;Grey dashed = «planned» (Register v1.4, not in code); amber «changed» = meaning or values change in v1.4. White box = parent entity of another area or part, key only. Audit references to User are not drawn. Removed items: Notes of Figure 4.2." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1026" width="1528" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="139" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt; — Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead (revenue line types, survival rate, Standard Cost of the funded boxes)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1105" width="1528" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Table 4.2 (1 of 3) Traceability C-L-P" id="Table_4_2__1_of_3__Traceability_C_L_P"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b&gt;Table 4.2 (1/3) – Traceability: Conceptual ERD (Figure 3.3) → Logical ERD (Figure 4.2) → physical table (Figure 4.3, 